  "brain_first": "“标题要短、准、能罩住全文；不是最酷的那一句。”",
  "sort_order": 1025,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "RECOGNISE - How it usually looks",
      "sourcePage": 40,
      "sourceIndex": 1096
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Which is the best title?",
      "sourcePage": 40,
      "sourceIndex": 1097
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "TERM - What the term really means",
      "sourcePage": 40,
      "sourceIndex": 1098
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Best title = 主旨的标题化表达。",
      "sourcePage": 40,
      "sourceIndex": 1099
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "THINK - First sentence in your head: “标题要短、准、能罩住全文；不是最酷的那一句。”",
      "sourcePage": 40,
      "sourceIndex": 1100
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "WHY - Why this works: 标题除了覆盖全文，还常带文章最有辨识度的核心对象/变化。",
      "sourcePage": 40,
      "sourceIndex": 1101
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "STEPS - Follow this route",
      "sourcePage": 40,
      "sourceIndex": 1102
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "1 先做主旨判断。",
      "sourcePage": 40,
      "sourceIndex": 1103
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "2 删掉只覆盖一段的标题。",
      "sourcePage": 40,
      "sourceIndex": 1104
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "3 删掉范围过大的“空口号”。",
      "sourcePage": 40,
      "sourceIndex": 1105
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "4 若两个都覆盖，选更具体但仍能涵盖全文的。",
      "sourcePage": 40,
      "sourceIndex": 1106
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "✏ 草稿纸上具体写什么： 圈题干人物/时间/地点/段落/核心名词/NOT；定位后在段边写题号；必要时写",
      "sourcePage": 40,
      "sourceIndex": 1107
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "“证据→选项”。",
      "sourcePage": 40,
      "sourceIndex": 1108
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "IF/THEN - If... then...",
      "sourcePage": 40,
      "sourceIndex": 1109
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· 问号标题常适合解释一个问题的文章",
      "sourcePage": 40,
      "sourceIndex": 1110
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· 故事标题可突出核心人物+关键变化",
      "sourcePage": 40,
      "sourceIndex": 1111
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· 不要因为押韵/吸引眼球就选",
      "sourcePage": 40,
      "sourceIndex": 1112
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "STOP - Stop when: 标题覆盖全文主要内容且不过度。",
      "sourcePage": 40,
      "sourceIndex": 1113
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "STUCK - If you are stuck: 把每个标题放在文章上方，问：“读完全文会觉得被骗吗？”",
      "sourcePage": 40,
      "sourceIndex": 1114
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "EXAMPLE - Worked example",
      "sourcePage": 40,
      "sourceIndex": 1115
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "全文讲城市树木如何影响局部空气质量，并讨论研究限制。标题“Can City Trees Clean the",
      "sourcePage": 40,
      "sourceIndex": 1116
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Air?”比“Trees Are Important”更贴文章。",
      "sourcePage": 40,
      "sourceIndex": 1117
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "TRAPS - Common traps",
      "sourcePage": 41,
      "sourceIndex": 1118
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· 选最宽泛。",
      "sourcePage": 41,
      "sourceIndex": 1119
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· 选最戏剧化。",
      "sourcePage": 41,
      "sourceIndex": 1120
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "CHECK - Final check",
      "sourcePage": 41,
      "sourceIndex": 1121
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· 是否覆盖全文？",
      "sourcePage": 41,
      "sourceIndex": 1122
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· 是否保留核心对象？",
      "sourcePage": 41,
      "sourceIndex": 1123
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "🔧 纠错动作： 做完不要只对答案，先给错误归类。错误代码： R-L 定位错｜R-P 同义替换错｜R-I 过度推",
      "sourcePage": 41,
      "sourceIndex": 1124
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "断｜R-S 范围/程度偷换｜R-N NOT/EXCEPT漏看｜R-M 主旨范围错。",
      "sourcePage": 41,
      "sourceIndex": 1125
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "同一种错误连续出现2次 → 在对应代码旁画★，下次做题先检查这一项。",
      "sourcePage": 41,
      "sourceIndex": 1126
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "MEMORY - 30-second memory: 标题 = 主旨压缩成一句。",
      "sourcePage": 41,
      "sourceIndex": 1127
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "可选巩固｜5题（查完SOP后再做）",
      "sourcePage": 41,
      "sourceIndex": 1129
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "1. 最佳标题除主旨外还要求？",
      "sourcePage": 41,
      "sourceIndex": 1130
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "2. 很有哲理但与大部分段落无关，能选吗？",
      "sourcePage": 41,
      "sourceIndex": 1131
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "3. 标题只写文章一个例子，通常？",
      "sourcePage": 41,
      "sourceIndex": 1132
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "4. 标题包含文章从未讨论的大概念，通常？",
      "sourcePage": 41,
      "sourceIndex": 1133
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "5. 判断方法？",
      "sourcePage": 41,
      "sourceIndex": 1134
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "答案速查：1. 简洁、准确、覆盖全文。；2. 不能。；3. 太窄。；4. 太大/跑题。；5. 问“全文大部分是否都能装进",
      "sourcePage": 41,
      "sourceIndex": 1135
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "这个标题”。",
      "sourcePage": 41,
      "sourceIndex": 1136
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "— R11 本题型到这里。下次卡住直接 Ctrl+F 搜“R11”或题型关键词。—",
      "sourcePage": 41,
      "sourceIndex": 1137
    }
  ],
